Package: secubox-watchdog
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, secubox-core (>= 1.0.0)
Description: SecuBox Watchdog — LXC + service + HTTP health monitor
 Health monitor for LXC containers, systemd services, and HTTP
 endpoints with auto-restart for failed targets. Real-time
 dashboard with 30-second auto-refresh.
 .
 Distinct from sibling packages in the monitoring cluster:
  - secubox-health-doctor — vital-services health check (different
    target set: focuses on SecuBox-internal critical services).
  - secubox-device-intel — asset discovery + device fingerprinting
    (network-side, not service-side).
  - secubox-netdata, secubox-glances, secubox-metrics — system
    metrics dashboards (different upstreams: Netdata vs Glances vs
    Prometheus).
